 (j) the inspection of premises used or suspected of being used as a factory, workshop,
 workplace or bakery or for any licensable trade or occupation or for the storage of any licensable
 article ;
 (k) the prevention and regulation of the discharge of smoke, steam, fumes and noxious
 vapours ;
 (l) the prohibition and regulation of the use of whistles, trumpets and noise-producing
 instruments operated by any mechanical means ;
