 467. Posting of standing orders and table of stallage, rents, etc.— A printed copy of the standing
orders shall be affixed in conspicuous place in the municipal office and a printed copy of the table of
stallages, rents and fees, if any, in force in any market, slaughter-house or stock-yard under sections 332
and 333 shall be affixed in some conspicuous spot in the market-building, market-place, slaughter-house
or stock-yard.

